# Bruschetta

Loosely based on [https://www.geniuskitchen.com/recipe/…](https://www.geniuskitchen.com/recipe/best-ever-bruschetta-443987) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20180812040627/http://www.geniuskitchen.com:80/recipe/best-ever-bruschetta-443987))

{ rating="3" image="bruschetta_toast.jpeg" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

- [ ] 2 [Roma Tomatoes]{ ing="roma-tomatoes" }
- [ ] 1/2 tsp [Black Pepper]{ ing="black-pepper" }
- [ ] 1/2 tsp [Basil]{ ing="basil" }
- [ ] 1/2 tsp [Garlic Powder]{ ing="garlic-powder" }
- [ ] 1/2 tsp [Oregano]{ ing="oregano" }
- [ ] 1 tsp [olive oil]{ ing="olive-oil" }

## Recipe

1. Blend in mini food processor or mince and combine
1. *Variations*

   1. For a meal, serve on toast with poached egg. Top with [oregano]{ ing="oregano" }
   1. Serve on sliced baguette crisps. Add parmesan cheese
